[00:42.28]Sing to Jehovah. His great name is highly exalted.
[00:51.55]His proud Egyptian foes, He has cast into the sea.
[01:02.26]Praise Jah Almighty;
[01:06.66]Besides him there can be no other.
[01:11.65]Jehovah is his name;
[01:15.66]He has gained the victory.
[01:21.25](Chorus)
[01:21.40]Jehovah God, Most High over all,
[01:26.90]The one who is forevermore the same,
[01:31.66]You soon will cause your enemies to fall
[01:36.54]And sanctify your holy name.
[01:44.32]See now all nations Opposing the Sov’reign, Jehovah.
[02:06.82]Though mightier than Pharaoh,
[02:12.48]They too will suffer shame.
[02:17.08]Judgment awaits them;
[02:21.81]They cannot escape Armageddon.
[02:27.22]Soon ev’ryone will know
[02:30.86]That Jehovah is God’s name.
[02:37.18](Chorus)
[02:37.33]Jehovah God, Most High over all,
[02:42.26]The one who is forevermore the same,
[02:47.28]You soon will cause your enemies to fall
[02:52.20]And sanctify your holy name.
